{"3632940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Frost Kin", "steam_appid": 3632940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your curse took your brother's soul,</strong>  <br><strong>and bound it to yours.</strong>  <br>  <br>Now you wander the cold, <strong>transferring his spirit between temporary bodies,  </strong>   <br>searching for a way to return him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Preserve what remains of him — or break him apart to survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Frost Kin </i>is a story-driven survival game set in a mythic arctic wasteland. Armed with only a spear and the lingering soul of your twin brother, you endure the ice and the ancient beings that haunt it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/3701403e232d724f77dfeb83ecd0f039.webp?t=1783857892\" width=512 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>✦ SHAPE THE PATH OF HIS SOUL ✦</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/8c367821a83f6c10b72068962c077d57.webp?t=1783857892\" width=521 height=47 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/a7e7d08a1e3f4c1879f5ef2970554779.poster.avif?t=1783857892\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/a7e7d08a1e3f4c1879f5ef2970554779.webm?t=1783857892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/a7e7d08a1e3f4c1879f5ef2970554779.mp4?t=1783857892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Transfer your brother's soul between the creatures of the wild</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/6fc19046ae796115dd9400dac2f89a6d.webp?t=1783857892\" width=363 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/3701403e232d724f77dfeb83ecd0f039.webp?t=1783857892\" width=512 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wolves, hares, ancient beasts, and things far older - </strong><br>Each vessel grants new instincts and abilities:<br>Hunt, scout, traverse the wilds, endure the cold, or uncover hidden paths through the ice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/3701403e232d724f77dfeb83ecd0f039.webp?t=1783857892\" width=512 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>✦ A SACRIFICE FOR SURVIVAL ✦</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/8c367821a83f6c10b72068962c077d57.webp?t=1783857892\" width=521 height=47 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/c4379350ec40e0385f276f03c75f6923.poster.avif?t=1783857892\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/c4379350ec40e0385f276f03c75f6923.webm?t=1783857892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/c4379350ec40e0385f276f03c75f6923.mp4?t=1783857892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Kill, revive, and use beings to your advantage,</strong><br><strong>but beware - each transfer leaves a mark</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/6fc19046ae796115dd9400dac2f89a6d.webp?t=1783857892\" width=363 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/3701403e232d724f77dfeb83ecd0f039.webp?t=1783857892\" width=512 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Force his soul</strong> into wounded or corrupted creatures <strong>and it begins to fracture.</strong> <br>Those fragments <strong>can be consumed for  unnatural abilities.</strong> <br>You decide what you become, and <strong>how much remains of him.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/3701403e232d724f77dfeb83ecd0f039.webp?t=1783857892\" width=512 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>✦ SURVIVE THE WILDERNESS ✦</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Transfer a <strong>single soul between creatures</strong> with unique instincts and abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use them to<strong> hunt, travel, and survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Preserve </strong>your brother’s<strong> fading essence</strong> — <strong>or consume it for power </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Abuse his loyalty, <strong>and watch your bond decay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experiment with <strong>creatures, their abilities, and the rules of your power</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Navigate a dying wilderness with <strong>no map, quests, or handholding </strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/3701403e232d724f77dfeb83ecd0f039.webp?t=1783857892\" width=512 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>This is not an open world</strong> <br><strong>This is a closing wound.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/3701403e232d724f77dfeb83ecd0f039.webp?t=1783857892\" width=512 height=40 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your curse took your brother's soul,</strong>  <br><strong>and bound it to yours.</strong>  <br>  <br>Now you wander the cold, <strong>transferring his spirit between temporary bodies,  </strong>   <br>searching for a way to return him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Preserve what remains of him — or break him apart to survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Frost Kin </i>is a story-driven survival game set in a mythic arctic wasteland. Armed with only a spear and the lingering soul of your twin brother, you endure the ice and the ancient beings that haunt it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/3701403e232d724f77dfeb83ecd0f039.webp?t=1783857892\" width=512 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>✦ SHAPE THE PATH OF HIS SOUL ✦</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/8c367821a83f6c10b72068962c077d57.webp?t=1783857892\" width=521 height=47 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/a7e7d08a1e3f4c1879f5ef2970554779.poster.avif?t=1783857892\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/a7e7d08a1e3f4c1879f5ef2970554779.webm?t=1783857892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/a7e7d08a1e3f4c1879f5ef2970554779.mp4?t=1783857892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Transfer your brother's soul between the creatures of the wild</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632940/extras/6fc19046ae796115dd9400dac2f89a6d.webp?t=1783857892\" width=363 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img